  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Combine pearl barley, diced tomatoes, onion, and garlic in a mixing bowl.",
    "In another pan, heat olive oil over medium heat. Add white vinegar and yuzu-cure. Bring to simmering point.",
    "Pour the vinegar mixture over the vegetable mix and toss well until evenly distributed.",
    "Place barley mixture into an oven-safe dish and pour the vinegar mixture over it as well.",
    "Bake for 40 minutes or until the barley is tender but not mushy.",
    "Let cool slightly before serving."
